                                                "sense_id": "6784607e-52a7-3992-b19c-0aeaa0d02434",
                                                "text": "The king’s authority held sway not only over the knight’s mighty sword, but also over the episcopal cross and aspergillum: for the bishops plied back and forth between court and province like all the other lords."
